    {
      "id": 901,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [60, 100],
      "size": [560, 760],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 40,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Lip sync: a talking video from a photo and audio with LTX 2.3",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Lip sync: a talking video from a photo and audio with LTX 2.3\n\nMakes a video of the person in your photo speaking your audio with LTX 2.3 22B in two stages, half size then twice the size with the spatial upscaler, while your audio stays fixed as the model's audio, and puts your audio on the video. Built from Comfy's template video_ltx2_3_ia2v.\n\n## Models\n\n- [ltx-2.3-22b-dev-fp8.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-fp8/resolve/main/ltx-2.3-22b-dev-fp8.safetensors): LTX 2.3 22B dev, fp8, with its video and audio VAEs, [LTX-2 Community License](https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2/blob/main/LICENSE-2).\n- [ltx_2.3_22b_distilled_1.1_lora_dynamic_fro09_avg_rank_111_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/ltx-2.3/resolve/main/split_files/loras/ltx_2.3_22b_distilled_1.1_lora_dynamic_fro09_avg_rank_111_bf16.safetensors): LTX 2.3 22B distilled LoRA 1.1, [LTX-2 Community License](https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2/blob/main/LICENSE-2).\n- [gemma_3_12B_it_fp4_mixed.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/ltx-2/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/gemma_3_12B_it_fp4_mixed.safetensors): Gemma 3 12B text encoder, fp4, [Gemma Terms of Use](https://ai.google.dev/gemma/terms).\n- [ltx-2.3-spatial-upscaler-x2-1.1.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3/resolve/main/ltx-2.3-spatial-upscaler-x2-1.1.safetensors): LTX 2.3 spatial upscaler, 2 times, [LTX-2 Community License](https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2/blob/main/LICENSE-2).\n\nRosesfield ships no weights. Each loader lists its file with a download link.\n\nPart of [Rosesfield](https://github.com/rossaai/rosesfield), MIT. Built from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates, MIT, per NOTICE."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
